# Arabic (ar) catalog for Micro-Vocal Lab.
# Domain: mvl-app (cargo package name). English source strings live in the
# .slint files; this catalog is compiled in at build time and selected at
# runtime with slint::translations::select_bundled_translation("ar").
# Units follow the plan (§8.6): metrology units and digits stay Western
# (dB stays dB; "mm" reads better localized as مم in running text).
